{"prompt": {"messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "You are a helpful assistant that translates Java code to Python 3 code. The code should reads and writes I/O from the console."}, {"role": "user", "content": "Translate the following Java 8 code to Python 3 code. The code reads and writes I/O from the console. Your translated code should have the exact same functionality as the given code, meaning that it should have the same output for any given input.\nPrint your translated code and also the confidence score you give to your translation. The confidence score should be a number between 0 and 1. The format of the output should be:\n<translated_code>\n<your_translated_code>\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n<your_confidence_score>\n</confidence>\nDo not provide any other text or markdown fences.\n\nHere is the original Java 8 code you have to translate:\n<original_code>\n<your_rewritten_code_2>\nimport java.io.*;\nimport java.util.*;\n\npublic class Main2 {\n\n    private static final int MOD = 998244353;\n    private static long[] fac;\n\n    public static void main(String[] args) throws Exception {\n        FastReader reader = new FastReader();\n        PrintWriter out = new PrintWriter(System.out);\n        \n        int N = reader.nextInt();\n        long pk = reader.nextLong();\n        \n        if (pk > N - 1) {\n            out.println(0);\n            out.close();\n            return;\n        }\n        \n        int k = (int) pk;\n        int c = N - k;\n        \n        fac = new long[N + 1];\n        fac[0] = 1;\n        for (int i = 1; i <= N; i++) {\n            fac[i] = (i * fac[i - 1]) % MOD;\n        }\n        \n        long result = computeAnswer(c, N);\n        \n        if (k > 0) {\n            result = (2 * result) % MOD;\n        }\n        \n        result = (result * combination(N, c)) % MOD;\n        out.println(result);\n        out.close();\n    }\n    \n    private static long computeAnswer(int c, int N) {\n        long ans = 0;\n        int sign = 1;\n        \n        for (int i = c; i >= 0; i--) {\n            long term = sign * ((combination(c, i) * modPow(i, N)) % MOD);\n            ans = (ans + term + MOD) % MOD;\n            sign = -sign;\n        }\n        \n        return ans;\n    }\n    \n    private static long combination(int n, int r) {\n        if (r < 0 || r > n) return 0;\n        long denom = (fac[r] * fac[n - r]) % MOD;\n        return (fac[n] * modInverse(denom)) % MOD;\n    }\n    \n    private static long modPow(long base, int exp) {\n        long res = 1;\n        base %= MOD;\n        while (exp > 0) {\n            if ((exp & 1) == 1) res = (res * base) % MOD;\n            base = (base * base) % MOD;\n            exp >>= 1;\n        }\n        return res;\n    }\n    \n    private static long modInverse(long a) {\n        return modPow(a, MOD - 2);\n    }\n    \n    static class FastReader {\n        BufferedReader br;\n        StringTokenizer st;\n        \n        public FastReader() {\n            br = new BufferedReader(new InputStreamReader(System.in));\n        }\n        \n        String next() throws Exception {\n            while (st == null || !st.hasMoreTokens()) {\n                st = new StringTokenizer(br.readLine());\n            }\n            return st.nextToken();\n        }\n        \n        int nextInt() throws Exception { return Integer.parseInt(next()); }\n        long nextLong() throws Exception { return Long.parseLong(next()); }\n    }\n}\n</your_rewritten_code_2>\n</original_code>\n"}], "temp": 0, "sample_size": 1, "logprobs": true, "model": "qwen/qwen3-coder-next"}, "response": {"samples": [{"content": "<translated_code>\nimport sys\nimport math\n\nMOD = 998244353\n\ndef mod_pow(base, exp):\n    res = 1\n    base %= MOD\n    while exp > 0:\n        if (exp & 1) == 1:\n            res = (res * base) % MOD\n        base = (base * base) % MOD\n        exp >>= 1\n    return res\n\ndef mod_inverse(a):\n    return mod_pow(a, MOD - 2)\n\ndef precompute_factorials(n):\n    fac = [1] * (n + 1)\n    for i in range(1, n + 1):\n        fac[i] = (i * fac[i - 1]) % MOD\n    return fac\n\ndef combination(n, r, fac):\n    if r < 0 or r > n:\n        return 0\n    denom = (fac[r] * fac[n - r]) % MOD\n    return (fac[n] * mod_inverse(denom)) % MOD\n\ndef compute_answer(c, N, fac):\n    ans = 0\n    sign = 1\n    \n    for i in range(c, -1, -1):\n        comb = combination(c, i, fac)\n        term = sign * (comb * mod_pow(i, N)) % MOD\n        ans = (ans + term + MOD) % MOD\n        sign = -sign\n    \n    return ans\n\ndef main():\n    data = sys.stdin.read().split()\n    if not data:\n        return\n    \n    N = int(data[0])\n    pk = int(data[1])\n    \n    if pk > N - 1:\n        print(0)\n        return\n    \n    k = pk\n    c = N - k\n    \n    fac = precompute_factorials(N)\n    \n    result = compute_answer(c, N, fac)\n    \n    if k > 0:\n        result = (2 * result) % MOD\n    \n    result = (result * combination(N, c, fac)) % MOD\n    print(result)\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n0.95\n</confidence>", "token_logprobs": [-6.3774932641536e-05, -1.311301275563892e-06, -3.576278118089249e-07, -0.009945246390998363, -0.004338020924478769, -0.00760860089212656, -0.003350836457684636, -0.007472185418009758, -0.0010332489619031549, -0.00025018901214934886, 0.0, -5.960462772236497e-07, 0.0, -7.152555099310121e-07, -1.5497195136049413e-06, -1.0728830375228426e-06, -4.529942543740617e-06, -8.22540732769994e-06, -0.000248043768806383, -2.264974000354414e-06, -6.9141146923357155e-06, -0.5231271982192993, -0.03426247835159302, -0.02795534022152424, -0.005786809138953686, -1.1920922133867862e-06, 0.0, -6.6756979322235566e-06, -0.25193655490875244, -1.4305104514278355e-06, -0.001474127871915698, 0.0, 0.0, -2.3841855067985307e-07, -3.576278118089249e-07, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -9.536738616588991e-07, -1.1324817933200393e-05, -1.2397689715726301e-05, -7.152555099310121e-07